<title>PHILIPPINES: Cebu Holdings up 6.56 pct in mid-trade.</title>
<headline>Cebu Holdings up 6.56 pct in mid-trade.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cebu Holdings Inc, a unit of Ayala Corp, rose by 16 centavos, or 6.56 percent, to 2.60 pesos in mid-session on Monday.</p>
<p>Traders said the stock was attracting buyers because it had been undervalued.</p>
<p>&quot;It's been a laggard issue and now it's catching up with the market,&quot; said Felix Barrientos, dealer at ING Barings.</p>
</text>
